    <p class="tag">Core Service</p>
    <h1>Extensions and Compliance</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">Stay ahead of your visa obligations, wherever you are in your stay.</p>

    <p>Foreign nationals already in the Philippines are subject to ongoing visa and reporting obligations. Foreign Immigration Services helps you extend your authorised stay and remain compliant with applicable Bureau of Immigration requirements.</p>

    <h2>How We Can Assist</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Assessing your current visa status and the extension options available to you</li>
      <li>Preparing and lodging extension applications where appropriate</li>
      <li>Advising on reporting and other ongoing compliance obligations</li>
      <li>Helping you address a lapse in status where one has occurred</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Common Situations We Handle</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Extending an existing visa or authorised stay</li>
      <li>An approaching expiry that needs to be addressed</li>
      <li>Understanding your reporting obligations while in the Philippines</li>
      <li>Resolving a stay that has lapsed or become overdue for extension</li>
      <li>Other extension or compliance-related circumstances</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How the Process Works</h2>
    <ol class="step-list">
      <li>
        <h3>Initial enquiry</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your current visa status and what you need help with.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Assessment</h3>
        <p>We review your current status and explain the options available to you.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Preparation</h3>
        <p>We help you prepare the documentation your extension requires.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Submission and follow-up</h3>
        <p>We lodge your extension and keep you informed of its progress.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>What We May Need From You</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your valid passport and current visa or entry stamp details</li>
      <li>Details of your current stay and intended extension period</li>
      <li>Any prior immigration correspondence or records relevant to your status</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="service-cta">
      <h2>Uncertain Where You Stand?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your current status and we will help you understand your options.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/?service=extensions-compliance">Get Help With Your Immigration Status</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
